# .railwayignore — batas upload `railway up` dari D:/project.
# Sama dengan .gitignore root + target eksplisit. WAJIB ada: D:/project berisi
# banyak sibling project + target Rust (~7 GB) + node_modules; tanpa file ini
# upload bisa meledak ke puluhan GB.
#
# Yang HARUS ikut ter-upload (dipakai build):
#   komiku-server/  komik/core+cli+Cargo.toml+Cargo.lock  komiku-web/  deploy/  railway.json

# --- Rust build artifacts (paling besar) ---
**/target/
**/target-laneA/
**/target-laneA-server/
**/Cargo.lock.orig
**/*.rs.bk

# --- node/vite ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/

